On 2011-02-23 16:12, jjh wrote:
> hello:
> I have dabbled a bit with both simh and Ersaz-11 to the point of
> writing some macro-11 programs and running RT-11 and writing some
> simple Fortran programs. (It just doesn't seem the same without the
> blinkin lights and the noises of the RK05 or RL02 disks happily
